	langid = {english},
	annotation = {Services used by {GenoM} modules may specify their Worst case execution time ({WCET}) because {FIACRE} is into {TIMED} {PETRI} {NETS}. 
Chips {MAY} deduce this {WCET} from the function definitions, but chips is not yet timed so no need to rush on this concept
Chips has all {GenoM} module features specifiable, but not semantically included in the chips language. If {GenoM} compability has to be introduced for Chips, it would look more like anotations than language modification because that would loose our focus on Functional blocks dagrams.

